@startuml use_case_overview
skinparam defaultFontName "Noto Sans CJK JP"
skinparam backgroundColor #FEFEFE
left to right direction

title Spresense セキュリティカメラ — Use Case 全体図\n4+1 view Scenarios + arc42 §5

' ==============================================================
' Actors
' ==============================================================
:👤 運用者: as Operator
:👤 設置者: as Installer
:👤 保守者: as Maintainer
:🚨 不正侵入者: as Adversary

actor "🤖 Spresense\nデバイス" as Spresense <<system>>
actor "🤖 PC viewer\nプロセス" as PCViewer <<system>>

' ==============================================================
' System boundary + use cases
' ==============================================================
rectangle "セキュリティカメラ システム" as System #LightYellow {

  usecase "**UC-1**\nシステム起動" as UC1
  usecase "**UC-2**\n常時 MJPEG\nストリーミング" as UC2
  usecase "**UC-3**\n動き検出時の録画" as UC3
  usecase "**UC-4**\n録画ファイル管理" as UC4
  usecase "**UC-5**\nTCP 切断時の\n自動復旧" as UC5 #LightCoral
  usecase "**UC-6**\n設定変更" as UC6
  usecase "**UC-7**\n障害時の人手介入" as UC7 #LightCoral

  ' Exception scenarios (extension points)
  usecase "ES-1 GS2200M\nバッファ枯渇" as ES1 #Pink
  usecase "ES-2 WiFi 切断" as ES2 #Pink
  usecase "ES-4 PC viewer\nクラッシュ" as ES4 #Pink
}

' ==============================================================
' Actor → UC associations
' ==============================================================
Operator --> UC1 : 起動
Operator --> UC2 : 閲覧
Operator --> UC3 : 確認
Operator --> UC4 : 管理

Installer --> UC1 : 設置/初期設定
Installer --> UC6 : 設定変更
Installer ..> System : ファームウェア書込

Maintainer --> UC5 : 監視
Maintainer --> UC7 : 介入
Maintainer --> UC6 : 動的調整

Spresense --> UC1
Spresense --> UC2
Spresense --> UC5
Spresense --> UC6 : Phase 10\n動的 FPS

PCViewer --> UC2
PCViewer --> UC3
PCViewer --> UC4
PCViewer --> UC5

' Adversary (脅威モデル)
Adversary ..> System : 盗聴 / 不正接続\n(ES-* で対応)

' ==============================================================
' UC 間の関係 (extend / include)
' ==============================================================
UC2 <.. UC3 : <<extend>>\n動き検出時
UC2 <.. UC5 : <<extend>>\n切断発生時
UC5 <.. UC7 : <<extend>>\n5回失敗時 FAILED
UC1 ..> UC2 : <<include>>\n起動成功で開始

' ==============================================================
' Exception → UC 関係
' ==============================================================
ES1 ..> UC5 : 引き起こす
ES2 ..> UC5 : 引き起こす
ES4 ..> UC5 : 引き起こす

' ==============================================================
' 注意ノート
' ==============================================================
note bottom of UC5
  ⚠ ADR-002 v1.1 で逆効果と判明:
  PC FPS 6.74 → 2.77 (-59%)
  ドロップ率 53.7% → 74.2%
  根本: 構造的天井 #1
end note

note bottom of UC7
  ⚠ 運用ランブック未文書化 (X-4)
  保守者は手順を毎回再構築
end note

note right of System
  **関連文書**:
  • 詳細 UC: primary_use_cases.md (UC-1〜7)
  • 異常系: exception_scenarios.md (ES-1〜5)
  • アクター: actors.md
  • 上位要求: ../../01_requirements/FUNCTIONAL_REQUIREMENTS.md v1.0
  • 機能仕様: ../functional/ (6 SPEC)
  • 品質シナリオ: ../quality/QUALITY_ATTRIBUTE_SCENARIOS.md
end note

@enduml
